# Nexus Android builds

This host is headless. Do not use Android Studio, a host JDK/SDK, or an emulator.

Read `ANDROID_BUILD.md` at the project root before building.

**Required:** use the detached monitor — never attach a long Gradle/`build.sh` run to the agent shell (blocking or background+notify). Session cut-off kills the build and corrupts Gradle locks.

```bash
/home/warp/nexus/containers/android-build/monitor-build.sh start /home/warp/Dev/other/jellyfin-androidtv assembleDebug
/home/warp/nexus/containers/android-build/monitor-build.sh status
```

After a killed run or lock errors:

```bash
/home/warp/nexus/containers/android-build/monitor-build.sh clean-stale-locks /home/warp/Dev/other/jellyfin-androidtv
```

Logs: `/srv/android-build/logs/current/`. APK: `app/build/outputs/apk/debug/*.apk`.
